  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hateh_elohai_oznekha">
        <tei:pb n="9" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n20_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>O my God! incline thine ear and hear, open thy eyes and behold our desolations, and the city which is called by thy name; <tei:milestone unit="repeat-range" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hateh_elohai_oznekha/repeat"/>for we do not presume to present our supplications before thee on account of our righteousness, but in reliance on thy abundant mercy. O <tei:pb n="10" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n22_medium.jpg"/>Lord! hear: O Lord! pardon: O Lord! be graciously attentive, and grant our request: delay not for thine own sake, O my God! for thy city and thy people are called by thy name. <tei:milestone unit="repeat-range"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
